+    // dw5e-port: ported from xenia-canary 6bef1fb (2026-08-25). Don't abandon a
+    // partially consumed frame: Consume() hands over at most subframe_decode_count
+    // blocks per pass, so the pass that exhausts the input strands the rest of the
